WEBVTT

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:46.000
怒りの目がすらぎて全てを手荒かける Ikari no me ga suragi te subete o te agrakakeru The eyes of anger are torn, and everything is ruined

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.600
You are a great man!

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.040
A dream?

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.000
"Azaşkı Spaydalan"

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.510
Hey, it's Shinko calling!

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:39.360
Where did she go?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.150
Hello?

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.820
You're Yamashiro Takeya, aren't you?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:45.410
Yes, I am. And you?

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.150
Your girlfriend and five siblings are waiting for you.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.550
What?

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:56.620
I'm waiting for you at Hotel Urashima, room 813.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.930
Hello? Hello?

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:06.620
Takuya Yamashiro found out that the call was a trap.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:11.680
However, he had to rescue the prisoners, Hitomi and Shinko.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.400
Takuya began to act.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.290
I've been waiting for you, Spider-Man.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.130
My name is Juzo Mamiya.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.580
I'm from the Interpol Secret Intelligence Department.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.860
The Interpol Secret Intelligence Department?

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.620
What's that?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.340
It's a secret organization that fights against the Iron Cross.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.070
What?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:36.350
While you're seducing your sister and brother,

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.520
what's Interpol?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.490
That's not it, Spider-Man.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.410
Your girlfriend and siblings weren't kidnapped.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.530
They just came to the hotel pool to play.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.920
Don't say such things!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:54.230
If you think it's a lie, then watch.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.390
It's so fun.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:24.780
It's not possible.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.900
Please enjoy it.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.310
Interpol Mamiya.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:29.800
Hey.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.880
What kind of person is Mamiya-san who sent us this invitation letter?

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.180
I don't care.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:39.250
He said he was from Interpol, and he's been invited like this.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.390
But you're curious, aren't you?

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.160
No, no, no.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:47.640
I really wanted to find out who Spider-Man was.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:53.080
So I deliberately sent information to the Iron Division and attacked your brother.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.930
What?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:07:00.000
I saw Spider-Man appear near your lover and brother.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:05.180
And I finally found out that Takuya Yamashiro is Spider-Man.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:12.200
I found out your identity to break my heart and talk to you.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.940
I want you to understand this.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:18.100
Tetsu Jujutsu, you mean me?

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.720
No, they don't know yet.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:25.000
They will never know your identity.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.000
Look at this.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:45.310
In the middle of the year, the manmos tanker, which carries oil from Chukin Island, sank one after another under the attack of fishermen.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:49.200
We found out the cause.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:05.990
Spider-Man, lend us your strength.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.600
Let's hold hands and fight the Iron Cross together.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.020
- The Iron Cross is coming. - What?

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:30.000
Did they sense us?

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.140
Don't move from here.

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:28.880
"Come to my cargo ship."

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.000
Spider-Man is...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.390
I could feel that the time had come for a bloody duel with the Crossbeams.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:37.110
I've got it.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:44.090
I'm sure Spider-Man is the one who captured the Interpol's secret information office.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:49.240
I know who he really is.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.780
I won't use any means.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.830
At the very least, I'll expose Spider-Man's true identity.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:11:00.000
Professor Monster, Spider-Man is...

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.960
It will definitely appear on the cargo ship we are waiting for.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:09.250
The cargo ship was set up by the Iron Beast Squadron.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.590
Spider-Man is no longer a mouse in a bag.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:18.670
Amazones, don't get away.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.960
Please wait a moment.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.180
Spider-Man will definitely come from the sea!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:52.020
There's a high-pressure electrical network in the sea that generates electricity.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:57.430
Alright, do the test.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.210
Did you reveal Spider-Man's identity?

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:09.890
No.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.690
You're so stubborn.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:45.070
Stop it!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:52.870
I'm going to prove Spider-Man's true identity.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.780
I'm going to add a torpedo attack to the kombinat.

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.860
I'm going to make you shatter into pieces, Kaimao!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.000
Spider-Man's true identity...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:08.160
If you don't tell me your true identity, I'll blow up the Combinator!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.460
This is the wrong one.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:40.300
Let's burn the combinator.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:50.710
You're not going to die.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:09.410
Oh no, they've infiltrated!

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.560
The Spider-Man is still alive!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:12.320
Get him!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.160
Find the Spider-Man!

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.920
Don't let him escape!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.360
Find him, find him!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:05.010
Kira-ri-to hikaru hikari-no-me.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.690
Spine.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.690
Yasu-ra-gi.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.690
Sute-te-sute-te-o.

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.950
Sute-te-a-akuto-o-te.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.730
Sola-kakeru.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:21.700
Change me up, pardon!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:53.540
The Iron Cross Killer Spider-Man!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:58.120
Dance, Spider-Man!

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.060
I'm Spider-Man.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:55.670
Spider-Man?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.460
Don't run away!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.860
I will fight them until the end.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.280
You're the only one who has to run away.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.320
Spider-Man!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:17.920
Over there!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.720
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.530
I'm the Demon King of the Sea!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.450
Spider-Man GP-7!

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:32.940
Because...

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:53.530
This is not the same.

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:59.250
The鉄獣士団 will be able to get all of our weapons.

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:03.890
But I have hope.

00:23:03.890 --> 00:23:06.630
I'm looking forward to seeing your performance.

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:09.490
I don't like fighting.

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:13.690
But if the enemy challenges me in an unlawful way,

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.600
I will fight as a coward.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:26.780
Spider-Man has no rest.

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:30.000
When he feels at ease,

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.110
Or it's only when the Iron Beast has been annihilated.

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:40.340
The immortal hero, Spider-Man!

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:44.510
Run!
